OL,3,GNEWSACCTV shows hangar door falling on
OL,4,ABicester fire victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV footage captured the moment the
OL,7,Fdoors to a hangar collapsed and killed
OL,8,Ftwo firefighters and a member of the
OL,9,Fpublic, a coroner's court has heard.
OL,11,FFirefighters Martyn Sadler, 38, and
OL,12,FJennie Logan, 30, along with
OL,13,Ffather-of-two Dave Chester, 57, died in
OL,14,Fthe blaze that engulfed Bicester Motion
OL,15,Fon 15 May 2025.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
