OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACCTV shows hangar door falling on
OL,4,ABicester fire victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a pre-inquest review hearing in
OL,7,FOxford on Tuesday, senior coroner
OL,8,FDarren Salter said the footage showed
OL,9,Fthe collapse of the doors at hangar 79,
OL,10,Fand that it happened "within six or
OL,11,Fseven minutes" after firefighters
OL,12,Farrived on the scene.
OL,14,FHe said the full jury inquest is not
OL,15,Flikely to start until the start of
OL,16,Fsummer 2027 and there would be another
OL,17,Fpre-inquest review held before then.
